# Labs content

Each lab must declare authorized scope, stay local or on an official training target, and include reset instructions.

Pair a vulnerable artifact with a structurally fixed artifact and tests that assert forbidden outcomes, not only happy paths.

README must state the invariant, root cause, impact, fix, and detection/recovery notes. Do not put production secrets, real PII, or skimmable weaponized payloads in lab docs.

Labs must remain isolated from the future public site origin (`site/`).
